%%entity TurnaroundTask help: An independently assignable piece of ground work for a movement, tracked until completion or exception.
%%field TurnaroundTask.reference help: Task reference quoted by ramp teams in handovers.
%%field TurnaroundTask.flight_id help: Movement whose readiness depends on the work.
%%field TurnaroundTask.service_provider_id help: Contracted organisation carrying out the ground work.
%%field TurnaroundTask.owner_id help: Ground supervisor accountable for completion evidence.
%%field TurnaroundTask.service_type help: Handling activity performed, selected from the agreed airport service list.
%%field TurnaroundTask.service_type enum: ServiceType
%%field TurnaroundTask.status help: queued awaits dispatch, underway is being performed, finished is evidenced, waived requires a recorded exception.
%%field TurnaroundTask.status enum: TurnaroundTaskStatus
%%field TurnaroundTask.due_at help: UTC deadline agreed against the movement's turnaround plan.
%%field TurnaroundTask.finished_at help: UTC time the ground team actually finished, required for finished work.
%%field TurnaroundTask.completion_notes help: Evidence of completion or the authorised reason for waiving the task.
%%section entity: TurnaroundTask; name: Ground assignment; help: Assign the required handling activity and its accountable team.; rows: reference, service_type | flight_id, service_provider_id | owner_id, status
%%section entity: TurnaroundTask; name: Completion evidence; help: Record when the work was due and what the team actually delivered.; rows: due_at, finished_at | completion_notes
